==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/veːɐ̯/}}
* {{homophones|de|wer}}
* {{rhymes|de|eːɐ̯|s=1}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|were}}, from {{inh|de|goh|werī}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*warīniz}}, derived from {{m|gem-pro|*warjaną}}, whence {{cog|de|wehren}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|weer}} and {{cog|sv|värn}}.

====Noun====
{{de-noun|f}}

# {{lb|de|archaic|except in compounds and idioms}} [[resistance]]; [[defence]]; also in the sense of [[defenders]]; [[guard]]
# {{lb|de|informal|regional}} {{short for|de|Feuerwehr}}

