===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|de|gmh|wer}}, from {{inh|de|goh|wer}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*wari}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*warją|t=mound, embankment, dam, weir}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*wer-|t=to shut, bar, block, defend}}. Cognate with {{cog|nds-de|Wehr}}, {{cog|nl|weer}}, {{cog|en|weir}}, {{cog|no|vær}}, {{cog|is|ver}}.

